WEBVTT

01:01.680 --> 01:06.040
Cambodia, Northeast Siem Reap

01:30.130 --> 01:35.340
<b>Cambodia, Northeast Siem Reap</b>

02:01.200 --> 02:02.050
<b>Lord Frost.</b>

02:03.490 --> 02:04.790
<b>What is it?</b>

02:04.790 --> 02:06.710
<b>Blade is awake.</b>

02:13.750 --> 02:15.210
<b>So you're awake.</b>

02:16.220 --> 02:17.590
<b>Leave us.</b>

02:17.590 --> 02:18.010
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

02:26.680 --> 02:29.400
<b>How do you feel, Daywalker?</b>

02:31.690 --> 02:33.090
<b>What the hell is this!?</b>

02:34.120 --> 02:37.070
<b>One of Existence's research labs.</b>

02:37.070 --> 02:39.360
<b>You can call it the factory.</b>

02:39.360 --> 02:40.740
<b>The factory?</b>

02:41.910 --> 02:46.080
<b>Manananggal, Mandurugo,
Sundel Belong...</b>

02:46.080 --> 02:51.500
<b>You fought them all, and they were
all genetically engineered here.</b>

02:52.380 --> 02:53.840
<b>What a waste of time...</b>

02:54.250 --> 02:59.430
<b>it doesn't matter what kind of vampires
you cook up, I'll kill them all.</b>

03:08.230 --> 03:10.140
<b>Listen, Blade...</b>

03:10.140 --> 03:13.940
<b>I've sworn vengeance against vampires.</b>

03:17.360 --> 03:18.990
<b>Since that day...</b>

03:21.280 --> 03:22.110
<b>Dad!</b>

03:23.870 --> 03:25.830
<b>Dad, dinner's ready!</b>

03:27.410 --> 03:28.040
<b>Dad?</b>

03:31.040 --> 03:32.290
<b>Oh man...</b>

03:32.290 --> 03:34.060
<b>you're always like this.</b>

03:34.670 --> 03:36.250
<b>Dinner is ready!</b>

03:38.090 --> 03:39.510
<b>Yeah...</b>

03:39.510 --> 03:40.720
<b>Dad!</b>

03:40.720 --> 03:41.800
<b>I heard you.</b>

03:43.930 --> 03:48.060
<b>Professor Frost, I can appreciate
your dedication to your studies,</b>

03:48.060 --> 03:50.770
<b>but preparations for dinner
have been completed.</b>

03:52.810 --> 03:58.110
<b>Weren't you the one who said that we should eat
together as much as possible, since Mom died?</b>

03:58.900 --> 04:00.470
<b>Come on, up and at it.</b>

04:06.200 --> 04:06.720
<b>How is it?</b>

04:07.700 --> 04:08.540
<b>Delicious.</b>

04:10.330 --> 04:13.620
<b>That reminds me, about school...</b>

04:13.620 --> 04:16.500
<b>They said I should have no trouble
getting into college.</b>

04:17.540 --> 04:18.700
<b>I see.</b>

04:19.130 --> 04:21.590
<b>That's my son for you.</b>

04:21.590 --> 04:26.640
<b>When I get into school, I was thinking about
studying at the biology department...</b>

04:30.680 --> 04:31.680
<b>Listen, Edgar...</b>

04:32.390 --> 04:34.690
<b>I think you can tell by looking at me,</b>

04:34.690 --> 04:38.610
<b>but becoming a scholar doesn't make
much money, and it's quite a handful.</b>

04:38.610 --> 04:39.690
<b>I know!</b>

04:41.610 --> 04:45.610
<b>Even so, I want to become
a scholar like you,</b>

04:45.610 --> 04:48.220
<b>and help you with your research.</b>

04:49.790 --> 04:51.370
<b>Edgar...</b>

04:56.830 --> 04:57.840
<b>I see...</b>

05:30.200 --> 05:31.620
<b>You did it, Edgar!</b>

05:32.540 --> 05:33.290
<b>Dad!</b>

05:37.330 --> 05:38.100
<b>Congratulations.</b>

05:38.580 --> 05:40.420
<b>I still can't believe it...</b>

05:40.420 --> 05:42.630
<b>Me, the Valedictorian?</b>

05:46.130 --> 05:47.340
<b>You earned it.</b>

05:48.510 --> 05:51.640
<b>Edgar, I'm so proud of you.</b>

05:52.600 --> 05:54.390
<b>I'm sure your mother is happy too.</b>

05:57.230 --> 05:59.310
<b>Thank you, Dad...</b>

06:03.360 --> 06:07.530
<b>Edgar was at the top of his class,
and had remarkable potential.</b>

06:09.490 --> 06:12.080
<b>He had a bright future ahead of him.</b>

06:21.380 --> 06:22.020
<b>I'm home!</b>

06:24.050 --> 06:26.880
<b>Sorry, I ended up leaving late...</b>

06:27.670 --> 06:28.550
<b>Edgar?</b>

06:28.550 --> 06:29.300
<b>Where are you?</b>

06:31.350 --> 06:33.030
<b>That looks delicious...</b>

06:33.930 --> 06:34.970
<b>Were you waiting for me?</b>

06:35.720 --> 06:37.180
<b>Sorry about that, Edgar.</b>

06:50.700 --> 06:51.490
<b>Edgar!</b>

06:54.160 --> 06:54.950
<b>Edgar!</b>

06:55.700 --> 06:56.040
<b>Hey!</b>

06:56.500 --> 06:58.220
<b>Say something, Edgar!</b>

06:58.710 --> 07:04.670
<b>Edgar!</b>

07:45.540 --> 07:46.550
<b>Why!?</b>

07:46.550 --> 07:47.980
<b>Re-open the investigation!</b>

07:48.460 --> 07:51.930
<b>It's clear that Edgar's death was abnormal!</b>

07:52.550 --> 07:59.020
<b>I understand how you feel, Professor
Frost, but it's like we've explained...</b>

07:59.980 --> 08:03.310
<b>There's no way it was just
a random act of violence!</b>

08:03.310 --> 08:10.990
<b>But, sir, there's even a witness that reported that
your son was attacked by a trespasser...</b>

08:10.990 --> 08:13.980
<b>Edgar was bitten by
something on the neck!</b>

08:14.540 --> 08:17.390
<b>You can't expect a biology professor
to miss a detail like that!</b>

08:18.450 --> 08:22.290
<b>Why did it seem like Edgar had
been drained of all his blood!?</b>

08:25.630 --> 08:26.420
<b>What are you doing'?</b>

08:29.000 --> 08:30.130
<b>Go home.</b>

08:31.260 --> 08:31.630
<b>Hey!</b>

09:08.170 --> 09:09.840
<b>Please...</b>

09:09.840 --> 09:11.630
<b>Look into it again...</b>

09:11.630 --> 09:14.720
<b>Professor, the case has been closed.</b>

09:15.300 --> 09:18.390
<b>It doesn't matter how many
files you bring to us.</b>

09:19.970 --> 09:22.520
<b>I know you're working with them,</b>

09:22.520 --> 09:26.650
<b>and are covering up my son's death!</b>

09:26.650 --> 09:28.270
<b>What are you babbling about?</b>

09:32.480 --> 09:35.610
<b>Oh my, he's there again?</b>

09:35.610 --> 09:38.200
<b>Is he still acting delusional?</b>

09:38.910 --> 09:43.200
<b>He seriously believes
a vampire killed his son.</b>

09:45.540 --> 09:49.460
<b>Every day he goes to the police,
and they turn him away every time.</b>

09:50.210 --> 09:54.630
<b>I feel sorry for him,
it's so pathetic...</b>

10:00.180 --> 10:03.520
<b>I swore that I'd have vengeance
against the vampires...</b>

10:03.520 --> 10:08.810
<b>and the humans who worked to hide
their involvement in Edgar's death.</b>

10:11.110 --> 10:14.860
<b>I hired vampire hunters, and wandered
all over the world searching for them...</b>

10:29.330 --> 10:30.830
<b>Professor, now!</b>

10:53.690 --> 10:59.950
<b>That's another step forward
for your research, professor.</b>

10:59.950 --> 11:01.110
<b>Yeah...</b>

11:01.110 --> 11:03.910
<b>a cure for the vampire virus.</b>

11:04.410 --> 11:07.660
<b>I dunno if it's possible, but...</b>

11:09.540 --> 11:10.670
<b>Don't be stupid!</b>

11:10.670 --> 11:11.920
<b>The professor can...</b>

11:17.510 --> 11:18.920
<b>Professor...</b>

11:19.760 --> 11:20.800
<b>What are you?</b>

11:24.350 --> 11:25.390
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

11:26.060 --> 11:31.270
<b>The story I told you about
curing vampirism was a lie.</b>

11:43.870 --> 11:44.910
<b>That's it...</b>

11:46.030 --> 11:50.040
<b>How does it feel to be
reborn as vampires?</b>

11:50.040 --> 11:52.750
<b>And no ordinary vampires...</b>

11:52.750 --> 11:57.050
<b>specially bred vampires born from genetically
engineering countless different types.</b>

12:08.220 --> 12:09.430
<b>You seem to be taking to it better.</b>

12:10.230 --> 12:13.480
<b>Good, now complete
your transformation!</b>

12:26.030 --> 12:28.740
<b>I suppose for a sample
it'll have to do...</b>

12:29.750 --> 12:31.870
<b>If I could only find a way to
increase the compatibility...</b>

12:33.370 --> 12:37.000
<b>I need to find a way to identify
individual characteristics.</b>

12:37.000 --> 12:38.040
<b>This is good.</b>

12:42.630 --> 12:45.680
<b>As soon as I began to hunt vampires,
it became clear to me.</b>

12:46.800 --> 12:49.260
<b>There's too many of them...</b>

12:49.260 --> 12:53.270
<b>It'd be impossible for <i>me</i> to ever
track down the one that killed Edgar.</b>

12:54.230 --> 12:55.100
<b>In that case...</b>

12:55.850 --> 12:58.480
<b>there was only one thing I could do.</b>

13:08.240 --> 13:08.910
<b>Edgar...</b>

13:09.530 --> 13:11.950
<b>I will avenge you.</b>

14:25.030 --> 14:27.740
<b>Just you wait,
you god damn vampires...</b>

14:27.740 --> 14:32.120
<b>I'll kill every last one of you!</b>

14:45.170 --> 14:49.180
<b>I became a vampire myself,
and built this organization,</b>

14:49.970 --> 14:55.220
<b>so that I could slaughter them,
and the humans who worked with them.</b>

14:55.930 --> 14:58.770
<b>This is my revenge.</b>

14:58.770 --> 15:03.480
<b>You caused a lot of collateral damage
for your bullshit revenge.</b>

15:03.480 --> 15:04.480
<b>Why?</b>

15:04.480 --> 15:09.200
<b>Are you so stupid you think
your son would want that?</b>

15:09.200 --> 15:14.530
<b>You've become worse than the monster
that you wanted revenge on.</b>

15:16.120 --> 15:21.250
<b>No matter what you say,
it won't bring my son back.</b>

15:23.540 --> 15:28.970
<b>In that case, I will continue down the
path that I have chosen for myself.</b>

15:37.470 --> 15:40.020
<b>Let me ask you one thing...</b>

15:40.770 --> 15:41.560
<b>What is it?</b>

15:42.060 --> 15:44.480
<b>Why'd you bite my mother...</b>

15:44.480 --> 15:45.730
<b>Tara?</b>

15:47.230 --> 15:48.780
<b>That night?</b>

15:49.490 --> 15:51.740
<b>That was quite a while ago.</b>

15:57.080 --> 15:58.500
<b>There was no reason.</b>

15:58.500 --> 16:00.120
<b>What!?</b>

16:00.120 --> 16:02.080
<b>I was thirsty.</b>

16:02.080 --> 16:03.960
<b>That's all.</b>

16:05.590 --> 16:08.000
<b>That's it!?</b>

16:12.680 --> 16:17.180
<b>Are you really going to lecture
a vampire for killing a human?</b>

16:17.180 --> 16:18.470
<b>Much less a filthy prostitute.</b>

16:19.020 --> 16:23.230
<b>Besides, my turning that woman
had an unexpected benefit.</b>

16:24.270 --> 16:25.560
<b>My dream...</b>

16:26.110 --> 16:29.230
<b>the dream of Existence.</b>

16:30.110 --> 16:34.450
<b>To regain the one thing that
I gave up to become a vampire...</b>

16:34.450 --> 16:36.870
<b>the sun.</b>

16:37.660 --> 16:41.870
<b>Not limited to the darkness,
out in the world freely...</b>

16:41.870 --> 16:45.330
<b>conquering the purebloods
and their lapdogs...</b>

16:46.420 --> 16:51.050
<b>I needed the blood of
the legendary Daywalker to do that.</b>

16:52.590 --> 16:57.970
<b>The one thing I was unable
to engineer myself.</b>

16:58.850 --> 17:01.890
<b>And to think,
I had already created it!</b>

17:03.390 --> 17:06.400
<b>Your birth wasn't a coincidence.</b>

17:06.400 --> 17:09.860
<b>Edgar died,
and you were born...</b>

17:09.860 --> 17:13.650
<b>this was all part of my destiny.</b>

17:13.650 --> 17:15.030
<b>Fuck you!</b>

17:17.530 --> 17:23.200
<b>Soon, Existence will bring about
a new world order!</b>

17:24.040 --> 17:27.420
<b>I will become king of the world,
lord of the vampires,</b>

17:27.420 --> 17:30.800
<b>and rule the pathetic
humans through fear!</b>

17:33.970 --> 17:35.430
<b>Shut up...</b>

17:35.430 --> 17:38.180
<b>You may as well be my son!</b>

17:38.640 --> 17:44.430
<b>Now, lend your strength
to your father!</b>

17:44.430 --> 17:46.850
<b>Deacon Frost...</b>

17:46.850 --> 17:49.310
<b>you son of a bitch!</b>

17:50.020 --> 17:51.110
<b>Yes...</b>

17:51.110 --> 17:52.150
<b>get angry.</b>

17:52.150 --> 17:53.650
<b>Angrier!</b>

17:53.650 --> 17:59.320
<b>Blade, let all of your power
come bubbling to the surface!</b>

18:10.290 --> 18:13.460
<b>That woman vampire hunter Blade had been
working with has infiltrated the facility.</b>

18:23.010 --> 18:23.970
<b>That little girl...</b>

18:24.720 --> 18:26.480
<b>I may have found a use for her.</b>

18:37.860 --> 18:38.700
<b><i>Blade!</i></b>

18:38.700 --> 18:40.070
<b><i>Where are you?!?</i></b>

18:58.420 --> 18:58.880
<b>Razor!</b>

19:42.430 --> 19:43.300
<b>A lion?</b>

19:46.390 --> 19:47.140
<b>Dammit!</b>

20:41.900 --> 20:43.200
<b>Blade...</b>

20:44.530 --> 20:45.110
<b>Hey!</b>

20:47.740 --> 20:50.330
<b>Hey man, wake up!</b>

20:51.120 --> 20:51.910
<b>Dammit...</b>

20:53.210 --> 20:53.960
<b>This...</b>

20:54.960 --> 20:56.130
<b>I came to bring it back.</b>

20:58.750 --> 21:01.420
<b>I promised, remember?</b>

21:04.680 --> 21:05.890
<b>You awake?</b>

21:08.010 --> 21:09.010
<b>Hang on...</b>

21:10.430 --> 21:12.430
<b>I'll get you out of there...</b>

21:13.940 --> 21:16.900
<b>Ma... ko... to...</b>

23:23.060 --> 23:31.070
<i><b>Partners</b></i>

23:26.440 --> 23:30.150
<b>Next time on Blade: Partners.</b>
